{"id":1135690,"shortDescription":"Unpacking es un juego relajante de lógica acerca de la sensación familiar de sacar pertenencias de cajas para colocarlas en un nuevo hogar. Mitad juego de bloques, mitad juego de decoración, podrás crear habitaciones agradables mientras descubres pistas de la vida que estás desempacando.","developers":["Witch Beam"],"publishers":["Balor Games"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Cromos de Steam","Tamaño del texto ajustable","Comodidad de la cámara","Alternativas de color","Controles de volumen personalizados","Dificultad ajustable","Opción solo ratón","Jugable sin restricciones de tiempo","Compatible con DualShock","Compatible con DualShock","Compatible con DualSense","Compatible con DualSense","Guardar en cualquier momento","Sonido estéreo","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"1 NOV 2021","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135690/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1789426289","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135690/ss_b32bfdd3f68e1f9e264bd37e10a464629ca034f8.600x338.jpg?t=1789426289","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135690/ss_b32bfdd3f68e1f9e264bd37e10a464629ca034f8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789426289"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135690/ss_9b358510285a4b70e446237de5996bc434415c01.600x338.jpg?t=1789426289","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135690/ss_9b358510285a4b70e446237de5996bc434415c01.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789426289"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135690/ss_8ad1858b98d2a04212a44b65ce2ae199e02a87cd.600x338.jpg?t=1789426289","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135690/ss_8ad1858b98d2a04212a44b65ce2ae199e02a87cd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789426289"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c